<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Spectacular isn\'92t it?\'92 Eloise prompted with as satisfying a smile as she\'92d ever practiced. Sarah was drawn so close to the glass her nose felt the chill of it. \'91There\'92re layers laminated into the windows\'97active filtering and realtime enhancement.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Where\'92s the Layer?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Well, it\'92s still there, of course.\'92 Eloise joined Sarah by the window. \'91But what you\'92re seeing is as faithful a rendering of what it might look like without the Layer.\'92\
